# Project Management Notes

This note is already formatted correctly according to the expected structure and spacing rules.

## Scope management

Define scope boundaries and acceptance criteria early to prevent requirement drift.

## Risk tracking

Track risks with owners, impact, probability, and mitigation plans in a living register.

## Stakeholder communication

Use clear status updates, decisions, and action items so everyone has shared context.

```text
status: green
owner: pm-team
```
